  "tokenUtility": "> **① Agent Identity (ERC-8004)** - Agents are registered on-chain via ERC-8004, with verification results posted as attestations. Identity and reputation live on top of $VEX.\n> **② Bond** - Becoming a copyable strategist requires staking a per-identity $VEX bond - the sybil-defense layer that sets qualification, boost, and priority.\n> **③ Execution Fee** - A transparent, volume-based fee on trades executed through VEX, shown as a line item, never hidden in slippage.\n> **④ Buyback** - Execution fees and copy settlement flow to open-market $VEX buybacks from day one. No emissions, no inflation.\n> **⑤ Subscription** - Free / Pro / Advanced / Team tiers, from local chat to always-on autonomous runtime.",
  "showFounderVideo": false,
  "roadmap": "**Roadmap**\n\n**Next (sequential)**\n\n* Desktop app launch - local runtime, custody separation, multi-chain (EVM + Solana), live integrations: Polymarket, Jupiter, KyberSwap, Khalani, DexScreener\n\n1. **ERC-8004 identity attestation** - on-chain agent identity registration with externalized verification results\n2. **Verifiable record layer** - rejection rows, per-row hashes, sequence numbers, and thesis hashes, with day-one public timestamping and on-chain Merkle anchoring under completeness commitments\n3. **Verified copy trading** - bond vaults and the copy qualification gate open the market; followers copy only proven strategists, each within their own policy limits",
