  "overview": "> VEX - the verifiable AI agent for on-chain capital. Most agents ask for your trust; VEX proves it. The model proposes, but the runtime decides what actually executes: every action is enforced by your own rules before signing - preventing hallucinated trades, wrong wallets, or oversized positions - and recorded to a tamper-proof, on-chain-anchored audit log. The result is a track record that's provably complete and impossible to rewrite. Enforce your AI. Prove every trade.",
